<title>CANADA: HORSE RACING-BOSTON HARBOR WINS BREEDERS' CUP JUVENILE.</title>
<headline>HORSE RACING-BOSTON HARBOR WINS BREEDERS' CUP JUVENILE.</headline>
<dateline>TORONTO 1996-10-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Boston Harbour won the $1</p>
<p>million Breeders' Cup Juvenile at Woodbine Racetrack on</p>
<p>Saturday.</p>
<p>Acceptable finished second, with Ordway third.</p>
</text>
